# 基本図形編集の実寸パネルと用紙枠を、デスクトップの図形編集とプロセスの図形編集で同じに出す
# (design 11.3, 17.13), for tools/ui_run.py. A figure of one rectangle and two zigzag lines
# (mkbig fig 1 2 0) opened at 100,100 to 900,700. 実寸パネル表示 (表示, its second row) puts
# 実寸 at the foot of the figure's window against its right (632,490 to 900,700), a
# subordinate window of the figure's; 用紙枠表示オンオフ (書式/印刷, its first row) draws the
# paper's edges over the figure. The menu opens with the item chosen last on the pointer's
# row, the rows 20 apart, and an item's own menu beside it with its first row on the item's:
# in the desktop's figure first 閉じる (表示 three rows under), then 表示 (書式/印刷 four
# under); in the process's, the system's menus remembering, first 書式/印刷 (表示 four above),
# then 表示. The screens with 実寸 and with the paper are kept for comparing; 実寸 at 640,500,
# where a zigzag line passes, has the line's black at its own size.
# Keys: Ctrl+E 08 01.
# the desktop's figure editor opened by open, whatever the program object says (figproc kernel)
figproc kernel
mkbig fig 1 2 0
open big
waitwin 画用紙 600
sync 600
wait 500
click 600 400 1
wait 500
move 610 460
wait 400
move 720 460
wait 150
move 720 480
wait 300
click 720 480
wait 800
sync 600
wins
shot vcmp_k_realsize
click 600 400 1
wait 500
move 610 480
wait 400
move 720 480
wait 300
click 720 480
wait 800
sync 600
shot vcmp_k_paper
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 500
mkbig fig 1 2 0
logmark
pfig big
expectsincein 60 figure: opened 画用紙 shapes 3
wait 800
logmark
click 600 400 1
expectsince figure: menu
wait 500
move 610 320
wait 400
move 720 320
wait 150
move 720 340
wait 300
click 720 340
expectsince figure: realsize open
wait 800
wins
shot vcmp_p_realsize
logmark
click 600 400 1
expectsince figure: menu
wait 500
move 610 480
wait 400
move 720 480
wait 300
click 720 480
expectsince figure: paper frame shown
wait 800
shot vcmp_p_paper
logmark
key 08 01
expect figure: closed
